 "note": "Where each row the library's turn can draw sits, keyed by the row's own id (rounds GA2-GA5): the birds it plays at (dice, over the house where a bird is not named) and the tempi it plays at (its own window, the row's `tempo.bpm`; the house's 95-105 for the two mined whole themes). A turn takes the rows nearest the playing birds and tempo (`src/library-draw.ts`: Euclidean over the eight birds, the tempo outside a row's window at one bird step of 0.15 per ten BPM) \u2014 no radius, no dead zone. A pattern row's birds are the spell it was audited at (the audit table under tools/); nothing here names a style, only the rows.",
